				141.12
			</span></i> (Corc. Nigra, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				167.13
			</span></i> (Mylasa, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθεῖναι αὖθις περὶ Μυτιληναίων λέγειν</span>
			<i>propose</i> a discussion about . ., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ συμφέρον ἡ πόλις προὐτίθει σκοπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.273
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. αὐτοῖς κρίσιν</span>
			<i>appoint</i> a trial for them, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				27.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. αὐτοῖς ἀγορὰν δικῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
