				</span></i>
			<i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προέθηκε . . λέγειν τὰ
				ἑκατέροισι . . κατέργασται</span>
			<i>has proposed</i> (or <i>initiated</i>) a recital of what each
